ndices 3.1.1, 3.1.2, and 3.1.3 to the report (March 1, 2019) from the Chief Financial Officer and Treasurer, consisting of: a. a Base Budget of $11.496 billion gross and $4.297 billion net to deliver existing services and service levels; b. an investment in new and enhanced services priorities of $63.596 million gross and $15.564 million net; c. contribution to the Scarborough Transit Reserve Fund from the 2019 Scarborough Subway Extension special levy property tax levy for the Scarborough Subway Extension of $40.699 million gross and net; and d. contribution to the…"]}